		{"id":"result","type":"text","text":"# `error/result.py`\n\n**成功 / 失敗を明示**\n\n- `Success[T]`\n- `Failure`\n- `FeatureResult[T]`","x":560,"y":100,"width":280,"height":205,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"types","type":"text","text":"# `error/types.py`\n\n**共通エラーの値**\n\n- `ErrorCategory`\n- `ErrorValue` / `ErrorContext`\n- `AppError`\n\n`code` の意味は機能側が決める。`cause` は内部原因。","x":20,"y":190,"width":390,"height":280,"color":"4"},
