		{"id":"boundary","type":"text","text":"# `error/boundary.py`\n\n**想定外例外の変換境界**\n\n`Exception` → `Failure(AppError)`\n\n- category: `internal`\n- 安全な code / message / context は機能側由来\n- 元例外は `cause` のみに保持","x":980,"y":230,"width":420,"height":240,"color":"4"}
